    "name": "Asphalt Aloha",
    "descriptionZh": "Gojek 自家的设计语言系统站点，只有 Foundations、Principles、Components 三个栏目，首页把资源入口做成 Components、Tokens、Typography、Accessibility 四张卡。",
    "takeawayZh": "看 Gojek 怎么把设计语言拆成资源、原则与组件三块",
    "noteZh": "导航一行是 Foundations / Principles / Components 加 Work with us。页面上半段写 Gojek's own design language system，下面一排四张白卡：Components、Tokens、Typography、Accessibility，各带一个彩色圆形图标。卡片区右侧那块 Foundations 标题下写 We design with the system in mind and never as individual flows. Our designs are consistent with the best practices and any outliers are avoided.，配 Know more 链接；左边并着三台 iPhone 的界面拼图，屏上能看到 GoBiz wallet、Active 标签、搜索框和 What's new on gojek 这几处界面元素。Components 一段收尾只写 Coming soon。",
